WEBVTT

00:00:14.790 --> 00:00:17.130
On I go, searching for...

00:00:17.130 --> 00:00:20.330
The past that was stolen from me

00:00:21.460 --> 00:00:23.420
Wandering on through...

00:00:23.420 --> 00:00:27.130
This city, so strange to see

00:00:27.330 --> 00:00:32.080
Choked by the scent of flames that seems to...

00:00:32.330 --> 00:00:33.880
Cling to me

00:00:34.080 --> 00:00:37.630
Didn't we both say our goodbyes...

00:00:37.630 --> 00:00:40.540
And go our separate ways?

00:00:40.540 --> 00:00:43.790
When you see the face of hell...

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:47.330
It will squeeze your heart dry

00:00:47.460 --> 00:00:52.750
Fighting on seems so pointless now

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:57.540
If this must be my fate...

00:00:57.710 --> 00:01:00.790
Then I'll make my mind up now

00:01:01.040 --> 00:01:05.960
So, please, won't you just leave me be...

00:01:05.960 --> 00:01:07.750
Another day

00:01:07.920 --> 00:01:15.250
Oh, will tomorrow hold something new to see?

00:01:32.710 --> 00:01:36.880
For a hundred years the Astragius galaxy
had been split by war.

00:01:38.130 --> 00:01:41.040
I was ordered into an operation
whose details were kept from me.

00:01:42.210 --> 00:01:46.500
There, my destiny was changed
the moment I saw her.

00:01:47.790 --> 00:01:51.000
She was apparently the military's greatest secret.

00:01:53.080 --> 00:01:57.580
Since deserting the army, my wanderings
had led me to the city of Uoodo.

00:01:58.750 --> 00:02:02.210
But, for a man like me
who only knows how to fight...

00:02:03.080 --> 00:02:06.170
combat in this city was something
I could not avoid.

00:02:07.750 --> 00:02:11.670
And within the battle, I met her once more.

00:02:13.170 --> 00:02:15.170
Now all I can do is try to pursue her.

00:02:16.170 --> 00:02:19.080
She's tied deeply to my destiny.

00:02:20.170 --> 00:02:22.170
But what sort of destiny is it?

00:02:22.750 --> 00:02:27.710
The Raid

00:02:46.250 --> 00:02:48.540
They definitely went in there.

00:02:56.790 --> 00:02:58.460
This is hopeless.

00:02:59.210 --> 00:03:02.000
Let the ground pounders have this.
All units, return to base.

00:03:04.500 --> 00:03:06.000
Let's give it a shot, anyway.

00:03:15.920 --> 00:03:17.420
That was close.

00:03:30.170 --> 00:03:31.830
For cryin' out loud.

00:03:42.710 --> 00:03:43.710
Huh?

00:03:45.830 --> 00:03:47.540
Looking for this?

00:03:49.250 --> 00:03:51.460
Son of a...! You...!

00:03:54.250 --> 00:03:57.420
Punishment for a failed mission. Think about it.

00:03:57.420 --> 00:03:59.580
What? What did I do wrong?

00:04:01.250 --> 00:04:03.630
It was a failure from square one.

00:04:03.630 --> 00:04:07.170
You didn't case the target well enough.

00:04:07.170 --> 00:04:12.420
Shut up! It was lousy timing,
thanks to you-know-who!

00:04:12.420 --> 00:04:14.880
Were you after the jijirium, too?

00:04:15.580 --> 00:04:18.290
If you were, you should have spoken up sooner.

00:04:18.290 --> 00:04:20.880
We woulda brought you in on the plan.

00:04:21.290 --> 00:04:24.290
It was just coincidence we were caught together.

00:04:25.580 --> 00:04:29.210
Quit keeping us in the dark.What were you after?

00:04:30.960 --> 00:04:34.500
So, where are you going? I had an idea.

00:04:34.500 --> 00:04:37.000
I want to talk about being your manager.

00:04:37.000 --> 00:04:38.630
Hey, come on!

00:04:40.880 --> 00:04:42.670
That hurts!

00:04:42.670 --> 00:04:45.330
Darn it, why can't he be straight with us?

00:04:45.330 --> 00:04:47.880
He won't die happy, that's for sure!

00:04:47.880 --> 00:04:50.670
I don't think he can play in any
Battling matches for a while.

00:04:53.000 --> 00:04:56.750
Let's let him do what he wants
and keep an eye on him.

00:05:21.920 --> 00:05:24.380
No doubt about it. It was her.

00:05:34.290 --> 00:05:38.710
What were those dirty footprints
in your shower room?

00:05:38.710 --> 00:05:42.130
He must have made them.
But I made no contact.

00:05:42.330 --> 00:05:44.380
But you must have noticed all that commotion!

00:05:44.380 --> 00:05:45.710
That's enough, Borough.

00:05:46.380 --> 00:05:48.170
This is serious!

00:05:48.170 --> 00:05:50.380
If Chirico made contact with her...

00:05:50.380 --> 00:05:52.040
There's no possibility of that.

00:05:52.040 --> 00:05:53.080
And why not?

00:05:53.080 --> 00:05:56.290
Because the Prototype says so. Stop and think.

00:05:56.290 --> 00:05:58.210
Do you believe she would lie to us?

00:05:58.420 --> 00:06:00.710
She can't do it.

00:06:00.710 --> 00:06:03.080
Not like a normal human could.

00:06:04.710 --> 00:06:06.380
Perhaps you're right.

00:06:06.380 --> 00:06:09.580
We've discovered his friends' hide-out.

00:06:09.580 --> 00:06:11.380
Assaulting it will be simple.

00:06:11.380 --> 00:06:13.670
All we need worry about is the jijirium.

00:06:13.670 --> 00:06:15.290
We'll talk in my office.

00:06:16.130 --> 00:06:18.040
Why not talk out here?

00:06:18.040 --> 00:06:20.420
It's not like she would betray us!

00:06:36.040 --> 00:06:37.420
Tomorrow?

00:06:37.420 --> 00:06:39.630
They're thinking of doing a city-wide sweep.

00:06:39.630 --> 00:06:42.210
All the cops'll be out on it.

00:06:42.420 --> 00:06:45.080
They always do this before they move the stuff.

00:06:45.080 --> 00:06:46.920
What are they moving?

00:06:46.920 --> 00:06:48.750
Jijirium. Didn't you know?

00:06:48.750 --> 00:06:51.500
They transport it out of the city once a month.

00:06:51.500 --> 00:06:54.130
And when they do, the place is crawling with cops.

00:06:54.130 --> 00:06:56.420
Business goes into the toilet when that happens!

00:06:56.420 --> 00:07:01.130
Funny thing is, they just made
a shipment a little while ago.

00:07:02.380 --> 00:07:04.790
Hey, pal. Want a drink? Oh, come on!

00:07:05.040 --> 00:07:06.790
I'm gonna be sick.

00:07:06.790 --> 00:07:09.750
What's Chirico doing in a place like this?

00:07:17.790 --> 00:07:19.290
There he is!

00:07:19.290 --> 00:07:20.830
Hey, baby.

00:07:21.670 --> 00:07:23.540
Wanna come with me?

00:07:24.460 --> 00:07:26.580
Well, aren't we a big one?

00:07:27.670 --> 00:07:28.750
Maybe later.

00:07:28.750 --> 00:07:32.040
You wouldn't be tryin' to blow me off would you?

00:07:32.040 --> 00:07:34.710
No, I'd never do that.
Just wait for me around here.

00:07:35.130 --> 00:07:36.580
You better mean that!

00:07:49.790 --> 00:07:53.710
Looking for something fun or something to eat?

00:07:53.710 --> 00:07:55.670
Something to get rid of the roaches in my place.

00:07:55.670 --> 00:07:57.040
Preferably poisonous.

00:07:58.170 --> 00:08:00.830
What exactly are you trying to kill?

00:08:12.830 --> 00:08:15.040
Where's the transfer going to take place?

00:08:15.540 --> 00:08:17.540
The transfer tomorrow.

00:08:18.210 --> 00:08:19.630
Who told you?

00:08:19.630 --> 00:08:21.580
Another cop, like you.

00:08:22.540 --> 00:08:24.960
If you're making that up, you'll be sorry!

00:08:26.130 --> 00:08:28.790
It's true. I'll give you this if you tell me.

00:08:29.250 --> 00:08:32.540
You'll have to earn it.
I want the time and the place.

00:08:34.670 --> 00:08:36.210
Confiscated.

00:08:36.210 --> 00:08:37.750
You're going to tell me.

00:08:37.750 --> 00:08:39.750
Maybe if you got down on your knees.

00:08:49.170 --> 00:08:51.210
Ever heard of the planet Daachimatsu?

00:08:51.210 --> 00:08:55.040
They call that nasty little bug you took an eunoi.

00:08:55.040 --> 00:08:56.460
Help me!

00:08:56.460 --> 00:08:59.790
Without this antidote,
you'll be dead in two minutes.

00:09:00.250 --> 00:09:02.000
Give it to me! Hurry up!

00:09:02.000 --> 00:09:03.210
You'd better tell me.

00:09:04.210 --> 00:09:07.540
05:00! At the airport! Give it to me!

00:09:07.540 --> 00:09:09.170
Thank you.

00:09:10.080 --> 00:09:13.380
That's a little vermin-killing bug I just bought.

00:09:13.380 --> 00:09:16.580
Once it gets a taste of your cop blood,
it'll probably take off.

00:09:16.580 --> 00:09:18.960
You won't be able to talk for a week...

00:09:18.960 --> 00:09:21.330
but you shouldn't mind that.

00:09:21.540 --> 00:09:24.420
In seven days, you'll feel like a new man.

00:09:31.630 --> 00:09:34.330
It's me! He's after the same thing we are!

00:09:34.330 --> 00:09:37.130
Five tomorrow morning at the airport!
Call you later!

00:09:41.960 --> 00:09:44.670
Gotcha! You're really great.

00:09:45.210 --> 00:09:47.960
So, you're after the jijirium, right?

00:09:47.960 --> 00:09:49.630
You think I'd tell you?

00:09:49.630 --> 00:09:54.580
Oh, don't be like that. You can tell me.

00:09:55.630 --> 00:09:58.420
How'd that eunoi get on you?

00:09:59.250 --> 00:10:02.710
Ew! Yuck! Get it off, Chirico!

00:10:02.710 --> 00:10:05.380
C'mon, get it off! Please!

00:10:05.960 --> 00:10:07.960
There's nothing there.

00:10:10.130 --> 00:10:11.630
Chirico, wait up!

00:10:12.170 --> 00:10:14.580
You promised.

00:10:14.580 --> 00:10:16.130
Maybe later, okay?

00:10:17.830 --> 00:10:18.210
I still have stuff to do!

00:10:18.210 --> 00:10:19.830
Oh, no you don't!
I still have stuff to do!

00:10:19.830 --> 00:10:20.380
I still have stuff to do!

00:10:20.380 --> 00:10:22.540
No! No! No!

00:10:37.710 --> 00:10:39.170
Here.

00:10:45.710 --> 00:10:47.080
That'll cause some trouble.

00:10:47.080 --> 00:10:49.540
We've got some major comings
and goings around here.

00:10:50.670 --> 00:10:52.290
Coconna told you? Don't do it.

00:10:52.290 --> 00:10:54.000
You'll be sorry if you get mixed up with me again.

00:10:54.380 --> 00:10:56.710
Same to you, guy.

00:10:56.710 --> 00:11:00.210
If we run into each other again,
it'll just be coincidence.

00:11:00.210 --> 00:11:01.960
Come on, tighter.

00:11:01.960 --> 00:11:03.080
All right.

00:11:04.080 --> 00:11:06.170
Cut it out! Let me go!

00:11:06.170 --> 00:11:07.210
Get in!

00:11:09.000 --> 00:11:13.250
What, are you kidnapping girls
to mine jijirium now?

00:11:13.250 --> 00:11:14.710
Not at all.

00:11:14.710 --> 00:11:17.540
We're gonna take you someplace far away.

00:11:18.290 --> 00:11:20.670
This city isn't treating us right anymore.

00:11:20.670 --> 00:11:23.670
We figure if we get about
a hundred girls together...

00:11:23.670 --> 00:11:26.040
we can start our own city!

00:11:26.670 --> 00:11:31.040
And your job'll be helping to
increase the population.

00:11:31.040 --> 00:11:32.630
The hell I will!

00:12:12.460 --> 00:12:14.580
Melkian Military Base

00:12:23.790 --> 00:12:26.420
You're saying the Prototype is in Uoodo?

00:12:26.420 --> 00:12:28.960
Chirico's movements confirm it.

00:12:29.380 --> 00:12:33.170
May I remind you that we
can't afford to lose her again.

00:12:33.170 --> 00:12:34.670
Understood, sir.

00:12:35.130 --> 00:12:38.540
I want the Perfect Soldier Project
to be the main topic

00:12:38.540 --> 00:12:42.540
at the 13th Melkian strategic defense assembly.

00:12:44.290 --> 00:12:47.420
My future depends on
the success or failure of this.

00:12:47.420 --> 00:12:49.710
Your future as well.

00:12:56.750 --> 00:12:58.000
Go to it then.

00:12:58.000 --> 00:12:59.290
Leave this to me, sir.

00:13:26.500 --> 00:13:30.290
You don't usually stockpile so many weapons.

00:13:30.290 --> 00:13:31.960
What are you up to?

00:13:32.500 --> 00:13:36.170
The same thing you are, my friend.

00:13:36.460 --> 00:13:38.540
By the way, where the hell is Coconna?

00:13:38.540 --> 00:13:40.170
Worried about her?

00:13:40.170 --> 00:13:41.580
Are you worried about her?

00:13:41.880 --> 00:13:43.290
I asked you.

00:13:44.210 --> 00:13:46.460
Oh, gimme a break! Why should I worry?

00:13:46.460 --> 00:13:49.170
She's just one girl.

00:13:51.880 --> 00:13:54.210
You guys are the meanest bunch of...

00:13:54.210 --> 00:13:57.080
You're unfeeling... Inhuman... Barbarians!

00:13:57.080 --> 00:13:59.750
Hold it, what happened?

00:14:00.580 --> 00:14:03.080
So, I'm "just one girl," huh?

00:14:07.170 --> 00:14:09.330
It was a joke. A joke!

00:14:10.380 --> 00:14:14.170
Anyway, you're in time.
If you're coming with us-

00:14:14.170 --> 00:14:16.250
You wanna go, then go!

00:14:16.630 --> 00:14:18.540
C'mon, don't be like that.

00:14:18.540 --> 00:14:20.210
Shut up!

00:14:20.210 --> 00:14:21.830
Calm down, Coconna.

00:14:22.210 --> 00:14:24.920
You cold-hearted jerks! Idiots!

00:14:24.920 --> 00:14:26.790
Go to Hell!

00:14:27.250 --> 00:14:29.500
I told them all about your plan.

00:14:29.500 --> 00:14:33.290
Now somebody else knows about the shipment.

00:14:35.580 --> 00:14:36.960
Who did you tell?

00:14:37.540 --> 00:14:40.460
The bikers. I told them everything.

00:14:40.460 --> 00:14:42.460
They're after the jijirium, too!

00:14:42.880 --> 00:14:44.330
You what?

00:14:44.330 --> 00:14:47.920
If they don't get you, the cops sure as hell will!

00:14:47.920 --> 00:14:51.210
It'll be a mess either way. I hope you're happy!

00:14:51.210 --> 00:14:53.250
You little idiot!

00:14:53.630 --> 00:14:57.290
You incompetent, pea-brained moron!
Get out of here!

00:15:01.580 --> 00:15:04.880
Why am I the idiot?
How can you call me that?

00:15:04.880 --> 00:15:08.130
After what you just said...
We didn't mean it, really.

00:15:08.130 --> 00:15:09.630
Coconna!

00:15:11.210 --> 00:15:13.830
Chirico! Where're you going?

00:15:13.830 --> 00:15:14.920
Chirico...

00:15:15.960 --> 00:15:18.880
This is a real mess,
now that those bikers are involved.

00:15:18.880 --> 00:15:20.960
We'd better put off leaving for the site.

00:15:36.290 --> 00:15:37.960
You're not giving up on it?

00:15:37.960 --> 00:15:38.790
No.

00:15:38.790 --> 00:15:41.750
Even after what Coconna said?

00:15:41.750 --> 00:15:43.960
Breaking up the team, huh?

00:15:43.960 --> 00:15:45.790
Who said we're a team?

00:15:47.500 --> 00:15:51.580
Listen, we know this town better than you.

00:15:51.580 --> 00:15:53.630
You just don't get it.

00:15:53.630 --> 00:15:54.880
I get it.

00:15:54.880 --> 00:15:58.460
Having the bikers involved
makes our job easier.

00:15:58.460 --> 00:15:59.460
Huh?

00:16:00.210 --> 00:16:02.750
What are you talking about? You are totally...

00:16:04.920 --> 00:16:07.670
They'll be going in armed like a small army.

00:16:07.670 --> 00:16:09.580
The cops'll probably have their hands full.

00:16:10.000 --> 00:16:12.330
Besides that, the airport's prepared
for a military attack.

00:16:12.330 --> 00:16:14.170
Major weaponry can't be used.

00:16:14.170 --> 00:16:16.000
I get you...

00:16:16.000 --> 00:16:17.790
But one guy in an AT...

00:16:17.790 --> 00:16:19.670
I see you have no objections.

00:16:19.670 --> 00:16:24.000
I was planning on throwing this one together, but...

00:16:24.330 --> 00:16:27.330
I hear you. I hear you, Mr. Sarcasm.

00:16:27.330 --> 00:16:30.500
We can't fix that pile of junk. Right, Pops?

00:16:30.500 --> 00:16:33.630
Right, I'll scare up an AT for you.

00:16:34.210 --> 00:16:36.460
Then let's discuss my plan.

00:16:57.000 --> 00:16:58.000
Right on schedule.

00:16:58.000 --> 00:17:00.460
For once I'm actually not nervous.

00:17:07.380 --> 00:17:08.540
What was that?

00:17:11.420 --> 00:17:12.880
What's happening?

00:17:22.420 --> 00:17:25.130
Uoodo's jijirium is all ours!

00:17:25.290 --> 00:17:27.710
All personnel, we are under attack!

00:17:27.710 --> 00:17:30.080
Enemy approaching from runway A.

00:17:30.080 --> 00:17:31.630
Neutralize at once!

00:17:32.080 --> 00:17:33.630
Return the trailer! Hurry!

00:17:36.500 --> 00:17:38.080
What are you doing? Move it!

00:17:52.080 --> 00:17:54.460
Our biker boys are really
putting on a show, aren't they?

00:17:54.460 --> 00:17:56.460
Coconna! Stick close to us!

00:17:56.460 --> 00:17:57.830
I hear you!

00:17:58.460 --> 00:18:00.830
I'm not gonna be a fifth-wheel on this job!

00:18:05.420 --> 00:18:07.000
Come on, move it!

00:18:17.540 --> 00:18:19.130
Don't use missiles!

00:18:19.130 --> 00:18:21.000
You'll damage the transport plane!

00:18:21.000 --> 00:18:22.420
Just stick with machine guns!

00:18:35.420 --> 00:18:37.170
Move out!

00:18:57.170 --> 00:18:59.170
Where's the jijirium trailer?

00:19:00.000 --> 00:19:01.170
There!

00:19:02.500 --> 00:19:04.580
If it gets into the tower, we've lost it!

00:19:05.170 --> 00:19:07.580
Coconna! Full speed ahead!

00:19:12.170 --> 00:19:13.960
What? A helicopter?

00:19:14.540 --> 00:19:16.710
Send out our own helicopters!

00:19:24.500 --> 00:19:25.750
Chirico, we're going in!

00:19:46.500 --> 00:19:47.500
Out!

00:19:55.830 --> 00:19:57.460
Vanilla, do something!

00:19:57.880 --> 00:19:59.330
No problemo!

00:20:03.920 --> 00:20:04.960
One more!

00:20:08.250 --> 00:20:10.460
Go for the jijirium trailer!

00:20:16.540 --> 00:20:19.920
What are you doing? They're just bikers!

00:20:19.920 --> 00:20:22.130
Send out the stand-by armored cars!

00:20:34.880 --> 00:20:36.630
Kill 'em all!

00:20:44.290 --> 00:20:46.750
I can tell you used to be a pilot!

00:20:47.880 --> 00:20:49.830
Used to do this stuff before breakfast!

00:21:02.420 --> 00:21:03.250
Damn!

00:21:14.670 --> 00:21:17.130
Chirico! Use this as a diversion to escape!

00:21:18.250 --> 00:21:20.080
Coconna! Get in the truck!

00:21:20.080 --> 00:21:21.330
Gotcha!

00:21:28.920 --> 00:21:30.080
Got it!

00:21:44.670 --> 00:21:46.790
What the hell's going on down there?

00:21:53.500 --> 00:21:55.000
The jijirium...

00:21:55.000 --> 00:21:58.500
Never mind those punks!
They're stealing the jijirium!

00:22:05.710 --> 00:22:09.000
Never mind the bikers, you idiots!

00:22:09.000 --> 00:22:10.670
Get the jijirium back!

00:22:36.330 --> 00:22:38.420
Everything had worked out perfectly.

00:22:38.880 --> 00:22:43.130
I cared nothing for the jijirium we now had.

00:22:43.710 --> 00:22:46.420
But if I was right, and it was tied to the Prototype...

00:22:46.420 --> 00:22:49.460
then perhaps she would come to get it back.

00:22:49.670 --> 00:22:50.670
Perhaps...

00:22:54.290 --> 00:22:55.710
Next Episode

00:22:56.750 --> 00:23:00.750
Faust sold his soul to Mephistophelese
so he could know the future.

00:23:01.040 --> 00:23:04.880
MacBeth fell into Hell following
the three witches' prediction.

00:23:05.750 --> 00:23:09.000
Chirico will divine his destiny from the Prototype.

00:23:09.420 --> 00:23:15.420
In Uoodo, what you need to buy your future
is jijirium and a little bit of risk.

00:23:16.290 --> 00:23:18.330
Next time, "The Deal"

00:23:18.330 --> 00:23:20.670
Business in Uoodo carries the scent of death.

00:23:19.880 --> 00:23:24.290
The Deal

00:23:19.880 --> 00:23:24.290
Next Time

00:23:42.540 --> 00:23:46.000
Whenever I'm feeling lonely

00:23:46.000 --> 00:23:49.540
Whenever I'm feeling sad

00:23:49.540 --> 00:23:55.920
I can always see you floating in my mind

00:23:56.420 --> 00:23:59.960
Whenever I'm alone

00:23:59.960 --> 00:24:03.380
Whenever I long for you

00:24:03.380 --> 00:24:09.630
I can always feel you inside my heart

00:24:09.630 --> 00:24:13.130
No matter how far apart we may go

00:24:13.130 --> 00:24:16.540
No matter if my path should part from yours

00:24:16.710 --> 00:24:23.040
The memories of you seem to shine inside my heart...

00:24:23.420 --> 00:24:29.380
Brighter than any other light...
